# Web UI design (agent must follow)

Source of truth: `apps/frontend/DESIGN.md`. Tokens live in `apps/frontend/src/styles/tokens.css`. Do not invent a second palette.

## Theme in one line

Primary = beige / off-white (surfaces), Secondary = muted plum `#714b67` (buttons), Tertiary = teal `#017e84` (links, focus, info). Flat: 1px hairlines, no shadows.

## Forbidden

- **Gradients:** no `linear-gradient`, `radial-gradient`, `conic-gradient`, `bg-gradient-*`, `from-` / `via-` / `to-` washes, mesh/shine overlays.
- **Emoji in the DOM:** no ⚠️ ✨ 🚀 🎉 ✅ ❌ 🟢 🔴 or similar in banners, buttons, labels, empty states, or tables. Use icons or Badge text.
- **Off-palette status:** do not use `#2563eb`, `#ef4444`, `#22c55e`, `#fef2f2`, `#991b1b`, or any red/green/blue not in DESIGN.md. Plum and teal are never status colours.
- **Shadows and thick borders:** the theme is flat.
- **Boxed pages:** do not wrap a page in a max-width bordered card. Lists and control panels run edge to edge; only forms and auth cards are width-limited.

## Status / error / success (use only these)

| State | Accent | Surface | Text | Border |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| Success | `#10b981` | `#dcfce7` | `#14532d` | `#86efac` |
| Warning | `#f59e0b` | `#fef9c3` | `#713f12` | `#fde047` |
| Danger / error | `#f43f5e` | `#fee2e2` | `#7f1d1d` | `#fca5a5` |
| Info (tertiary) | `#017e84` | `#dff1f1` | `#01666b` | `#8fcfd1` |

Canvas `#f4efe6`, surface `#fffdf8`, ink `#2b2430`. Reference colours by CSS variable, not by hex, in components.
